// подсказки (HelpWindow справа) и заголовки разделов
Base_Header GENERAL
Sprinting_Help Sprint: hold the key, or press once to toggle.
Crouching_Help Crouch: hold the key, or press once to toggle.
Aiming_Help Aim: hold the key, or press once to toggle.
Voice_Mode_Help Microphone: talk while holding the key, or press to turn it on and off.
SensitivityScalingMode_Help How sensitivity changes while aiming. Focal Length: by field of view with the projection ratio coefficient. Zoom Factor: by scope zoom. Legacy: as it used to be. Disabled: unchanged.
Sensitivity_Field_Help How many degrees the camera turns per pixel of mouse movement.
ProjectionRatioCoefficient_Help Aiming sensitivity multiplier for the Focal Length mode.
Invert_Toggle_Help Moving the mouse up looks down.
Invert_Flight_Toggle_Help Mouse up pitches the nose down in aircraft.
Scroll_Hotbar_Toggle_Help The mouse wheel switches hotbar items.
